# kgc-adblock — sink ad / attribution / analytics endpoints (appended to /system/etc/hosts).
# Under ndk_translation the ad SDKs' native stack (AdMob webview + UnityAds + Airbridge)
# kills the process with SIGABRT ("pthread_mutex_lock called on a destroyed mutex") or a
# SIGSEGV within ~1 minute of the lobby.  Blocking their endpoints removes the whole path
# and the client then runs indefinitely.  Do NOT block the game API/CDN/XIGNCODE hosts.
